        ".rte {text-align: justify;}"
      ],
      "settings": {
        "text_width": "wide",
        "title": "Joysway Racing Yachts at Hearns Hobbies Melbourne",
        "content": "<p>Joysway have been producing racing quality RC yachts for many years now and they have excelled with their two main yachts which each have their racing class.  Firstly there is the Dragon Force (or DF65) which has been around and racing for many years now.  There is also the larger Dragon Flite (or DF95) which has now become very popular with yacht racers. Our curated collection of <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/joysway-racing-yachts\">Joysway Racing Yachts</a>, accessories and <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/collections/joysway-dragon-force-65-v7-spare-parts\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Joysway spare parts</span></a> offers an unparalleled experience in the world of remote-controlled sailing. Perfect for both beginners and seasoned sailors, these yachts promise excitement, challenge, and satisfaction. Immerse yourself in the thrilling world of RC sailing with Joysway, a brand synonymous with quality and innovation.</p><p>The DF65 and DF95 are excellent choices for anyone interested in RC sailing, whether for competitive racing or recreational enjoyment. Their design, performance, and supportive global community make them standout choices in the world of RC sailboats.</p><p></p>",
        "button_text": "",
        "button_link": ""
      }
    },
