        "question_pjqdPK": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can beginners enjoy Joysway Racing Yachts? What do I need to get started?",
            "answer": "<p>Absolutely! Joysway offers models that are great for beginners, providing an accessible entry point into RC sailing. To get started all you need is an RTR DF65 or DF95 and some AA batteries.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_cmnG6a": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How do I choose the right yacht?",
            "answer": "<p>Consider your level of experience, intended use, and budget. Our team at Hearns Hobbies is always here to help guide your choice. For more inquiries or assistance, don't hesitate to <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/pages/contact-us-here\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">contact us</span></a> or visit our <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">Hobby Shop in Melbourne</span></a> or Narre Warren.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Ccc8ND": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "What do I need to get started?",
            "answer": "<p>To get started all you need is an <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/joysway-dragon-force-65-v7-racing-class-df65-yacht-rtr\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">RTR DF65</span></a> or <a href=\"https://www.hearnshobbies.com/products/joysway-dragon-flite-95-v2-racing-class-df95-yacht-rtr\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\">DF95</span></a> and some AA batteries.</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_yd7nfG": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Where can I sail my yacht?",
            "answer": "<p>You can sail your yacht in most freshwater lakes. Please be sure to get onto your local club by Googling or checking Facebook. And if you can't find one, maybe you could start one!</p>"
          }
        },
        "question_Jpw6BQ": {
